Z||000004||skitime||08-29-2001||01:34 PM||||I met a guy at the PA BBQ last weekend that has a 400 HP chevy engine with a archie kit in his Fiero GT.  I don't remember his name. He also has NOS which gives the engine 200 HP boost or six hundred horses.  He had trouble with blowing transmissions until he had a guy build him a posi-traction unit for it and since then he hasn't blown a transmission.  No, I don't know where he got the posi-traction unit but he said it cost him $400.  I don't know if he is on the forum but I don't think so.  <P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
